1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:06,720
ActFX is where you run automatic trading strategies.

2
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:10,580
There are four sections along the top.

3
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:16,700
Strategies lists your own strategies and the ones you bought. Ready-made ones are in the Marketplace.

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,560
Each one trades by its own set of rules. Run starts it, Test tries it first.

5
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:26,280
Editor is where you write or change a strategy.

6
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:31,500
Tester runs it against past prices to see how it would have done.

7
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:37,580
ActAI builds a strategy for you from a plain description.

8
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:40,940
Trading takes you back.

